WEBVTT

00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:07.150
Welcome, chosen one.

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:09.750
You may now choose

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:12.610
to become the only male transfer 
student at Pretty Girls Academy.

00:00:13.210 --> 00:00:13.990
Academy?

00:00:15.390 --> 00:00:16.830
Nezuya-kun!

00:00:16.830 --> 00:00:21.620
Or perhaps a super-popular 
producer at an idol agency?

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:24.210
Super-popular...?

00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:26.040
Judgment-niisan!

00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:28.690
I won a trillion yen lottery ticket!

00:00:28.690 --> 00:00:29.650
What do we do?

00:00:29.650 --> 00:00:31.760
Do we buy Mont Saint-Michel or Atami Castle?

00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:32.880
What? At—

00:00:33.250 --> 00:00:34.370
Judgment!

00:00:34.370 --> 00:00:35.100
Dad?

00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:35.970
Mom?

00:00:35.970 --> 00:00:39.720
You actually have a large-breasted 
older stepsister!

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:42.410
Large-breasted?

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:49.280
Nezuya-kun!

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:53.150
Hooray! Hooray!

00:00:53.150 --> 00:00:54.190
<i>Is this...</i>

00:00:57.020 --> 00:00:58.620
<i>I can't go on.</i>

00:01:00.010 --> 00:01:00.990
<i>Everyone...</i>

00:01:01.750 --> 00:01:04.160
<i>I'm so... sorry!</i>

00:01:13.610 --> 00:01:15.800
Th-The Nebula Weapon was destroyed!

00:01:17.010 --> 00:01:18.430
Where's Nezuya-kun?!

00:01:34.530 --> 00:01:39.200
<b><i>Planet With</i></b>

00:02:54.520 --> 00:02:58.610
<b>Episode 4: Avenger 2</b>

00:02:57.230 --> 00:03:00.200
Nezuya-kun! Wake up, Nezuya-kun!

00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:02.570
He doesn't seem to be hurt.

00:03:02.870 --> 00:03:06.580
He actually looks like he's 
having a wonderful dream.

00:03:06.580 --> 00:03:09.460
<i>Everyone, please withdraw immediately.</i>

00:03:09.950 --> 00:03:11.050
Roger.

00:03:11.050 --> 00:03:13.130
Understood...

00:03:13.130 --> 00:03:17.050
<i>Takezo-san, be careful when 
transporting Nezuya-san.</i>

00:03:17.050 --> 00:03:18.890
I know.

00:03:19.690 --> 00:03:21.860
I-I'm sorry.

00:03:22.830 --> 00:03:24.550
I'm going!

00:03:24.990 --> 00:03:27.140
Kumashiro-kun, where are you going?

00:03:27.140 --> 00:03:28.220
I'm sorry!

00:03:28.220 --> 00:03:28.970
Kumashiro-san!

00:03:29.550 --> 00:03:32.140
Is she planning to fight the Nebula Soldiers?

00:03:32.530 --> 00:03:34.730
I'll follow her!

00:03:35.260 --> 00:03:36.140
Me, too!

00:03:36.740 --> 00:03:37.690
Wait!

00:03:38.890 --> 00:03:41.880
Dad, bring Nezuya-kun back.

00:03:41.880 --> 00:03:42.400
<i>Okay.</i>

00:03:42.900 --> 00:03:45.220
Shiraishi-kun, find us a hospital.

00:03:45.220 --> 00:03:45.800
<i>Yes, sir.</i>

00:03:46.390 --> 00:03:47.660
Where are you going, Inaba-kun?

00:03:48.420 --> 00:03:51.750
I-I have to go be with Haru-chan.

00:03:52.940 --> 00:03:55.610
Torai-kun, go with her.

00:03:55.610 --> 00:03:56.130
Okay.

00:03:56.690 --> 00:03:59.340
I'll go check on Nezuya-kun.

00:04:02.730 --> 00:04:06.400
Why? Why is Nezuya-senpai out there?

00:04:06.400 --> 00:04:08.540
What, you know him?

00:04:09.760 --> 00:04:10.600
My friend.

00:04:12.450 --> 00:04:13.550
Is he a friend of yours?

00:04:14.200 --> 00:04:15.300
No...

00:04:15.300 --> 00:04:17.820
If he's my enemy,
then there's nothing I can do.

00:04:18.730 --> 00:04:21.530
Hey, is he... dead?

00:04:22.220 --> 00:04:25.410
No way, that thing doesn't kill you.

00:04:25.410 --> 00:04:26.500
I see.

00:04:28.820 --> 00:04:30.200
Nebula Soldier!

00:04:30.650 --> 00:04:33.660
Fight me! One on one!

00:04:33.900 --> 00:04:34.900
Sensei.

00:04:35.710 --> 00:04:38.990
"We can do this, Soya," is what Sensei says.

00:04:38.990 --> 00:04:39.500
Okay!

00:04:42.230 --> 00:04:43.670
I accept your challenge!

00:04:51.790 --> 00:04:55.270
Kumashiro, if I think it starts 
looking bad, I'm gonna join in.

00:04:55.670 --> 00:04:56.960
Please don't.

00:04:56.960 --> 00:04:58.230
Then win.

00:04:59.370 --> 00:05:00.190
I will!

00:05:05.740 --> 00:05:08.950
Um... do I need to give some kind of signal?

00:05:10.390 --> 00:05:12.620
Giga Cat...

00:05:17.700 --> 00:05:19.040
Hammer!

00:05:22.760 --> 00:05:23.380
She dodged it?

00:05:27.010 --> 00:05:28.960
Kumashiro's amazing.

00:05:28.960 --> 00:05:33.600
She's moving her Photon Armor 
like it's an actual human body.

00:05:34.230 --> 00:05:37.310
Kumashiro-san's kinda strong, isn't she?

00:05:38.060 --> 00:05:40.560
She sure is. And not just "kinda."

00:05:52.080 --> 00:05:54.140
Giga Cat...

00:06:12.100 --> 00:06:13.060
He used his leg?

00:06:17.200 --> 00:06:17.810
Kumashiro!

00:06:18.090 --> 00:06:19.140
Stay back!

00:06:24.160 --> 00:06:25.360
I took out both her arms.

00:06:26.280 --> 00:06:28.820
One good hit to the torso, and I'm done!

00:06:32.250 --> 00:06:35.330
I... can still fight.

00:06:35.540 --> 00:06:36.950
But your arms...

00:06:51.600 --> 00:06:52.590
She grew arms?

00:06:52.820 --> 00:06:55.250
She rebuilt her Photon Armor?

00:06:55.250 --> 00:06:56.430
That's crazy!

00:06:56.900 --> 00:06:58.720
But her arms...

00:06:58.720 --> 00:07:02.150
Yeah, I feel some terrible power.

00:07:02.410 --> 00:07:05.400
Sensei! Can you do that, too?

00:07:06.030 --> 00:07:07.690
"Don't ask for the impossible!"

00:07:07.690 --> 00:07:10.150
That's what Sensei says.

00:07:11.250 --> 00:07:13.830
She just finished fighting the Nebula Weapon.

00:07:13.830 --> 00:07:17.830
Is it okay for Kumashiro 
to use that much power?

00:07:29.070 --> 00:07:31.320
Miu-chan, don't cry!

00:07:31.320 --> 00:07:32.630
Leave me alone!

00:07:32.920 --> 00:07:35.580
Your match is about to start.

00:07:35.580 --> 00:07:37.040
B-But...

00:07:37.040 --> 00:07:38.470
Just leave me alone!

00:07:38.470 --> 00:07:40.730
It's my fault for being weak!

00:07:42.870 --> 00:07:46.440
I-I'll... I'll avenge you!

00:07:46.750 --> 00:07:48.300
We're different ranks.

00:07:49.130 --> 00:07:51.650
But I'll do it anyway! I'll win!

00:07:52.300 --> 00:07:53.610
Win?

00:07:54.310 --> 00:07:56.700
I'll win my match.

00:08:04.080 --> 00:08:05.790
Haru-chan, hang in there!

00:08:10.390 --> 00:08:11.380
Winner!

00:08:11.380 --> 00:08:12.410
The match is over!

00:08:18.520 --> 00:08:20.020
Wow!

00:08:20.020 --> 00:08:22.160
You really won!

00:08:29.150 --> 00:08:31.890
I'll avenge... Miu-chan!

00:08:36.930 --> 00:08:38.030
Haru-chan!

00:08:38.330 --> 00:08:39.540
Hang in there!

00:08:40.620 --> 00:08:41.700
You're mine!

00:08:45.520 --> 00:08:46.760
No!

00:08:48.920 --> 00:08:50.020
It landed!

00:08:50.020 --> 00:08:51.800
Now, <i>push</i>!

00:09:08.210 --> 00:09:11.860
I won't lose in front of Miu-chan!

00:09:45.830 --> 00:09:46.890
Haru-chan...

00:09:47.930 --> 00:09:49.100
Ow...

00:09:49.800 --> 00:09:51.760
What the hell is that?

00:09:51.760 --> 00:09:53.070
Kumashiro-san!

00:09:53.430 --> 00:09:57.030
It transformed when she rebuilt it?

00:09:58.740 --> 00:09:59.660
A dragon?

00:10:04.000 --> 00:10:04.900
A dragon?

00:10:04.900 --> 00:10:06.590
What's a dragon doing here?

00:10:06.590 --> 00:10:09.000
No, did she become a dragon?

00:10:27.760 --> 00:10:29.720
What's going on, Benika?

00:10:29.720 --> 00:10:31.210
Hell if I know!

00:10:31.210 --> 00:10:32.190
Kumashiro!

00:10:32.560 --> 00:10:35.030
Hey, Kumashiro, answer me, damn it!

00:10:40.170 --> 00:10:42.700
The power of the dragon...

00:10:51.210 --> 00:10:52.040
It missed!

00:10:55.550 --> 00:10:57.300
The city!

00:10:57.300 --> 00:10:59.050
Damn it, Kumashiro!

00:10:59.380 --> 00:11:02.010
Wh... What's going on?

00:11:02.680 --> 00:11:04.470
H-Haru-chan?

00:11:09.170 --> 00:11:10.120
Dragon...

00:11:12.230 --> 00:11:16.830
Her psychic powers interacted with 
the dragon's power inside the vial,

00:11:16.830 --> 00:11:19.360
and then amplified to the 
point where she lost control.

00:11:20.060 --> 00:11:22.730
That's what Sensei says.

00:11:23.460 --> 00:11:24.530
Which means...

00:11:26.530 --> 00:11:27.940
She's gone berserk.

00:11:38.170 --> 00:11:40.130
Kumashiro, wake up! Kumashiro!

00:11:42.050 --> 00:11:45.050
I'm losing track of her psychic signature!

00:11:45.450 --> 00:11:47.890
The dragon is swallowing it up!

00:11:48.650 --> 00:11:49.730
Benika!

00:11:58.550 --> 00:12:01.700
It's no good. The dragon's 
totally swallowed her up.

00:12:02.640 --> 00:12:04.200
What do we do?

00:12:05.070 --> 00:12:06.510
We stop it.

00:12:06.510 --> 00:12:07.930
Stop it?

00:12:07.930 --> 00:12:10.250
It's too strong!

00:12:10.250 --> 00:12:11.520
Let's go, Yosuke!

00:12:12.380 --> 00:12:13.170
I'll do my best!

00:12:24.650 --> 00:12:27.700
Hey, Nebula Soldier!

00:12:27.700 --> 00:12:29.010
Can you hear me?

00:12:29.310 --> 00:12:30.880
I want to stop my friend!

00:12:31.220 --> 00:12:32.890
Help me, please!

00:12:32.890 --> 00:12:34.770
Wait, Benika!

00:12:37.450 --> 00:12:38.860
I guess I don't have a choice...

00:12:39.650 --> 00:12:41.490
Giga Cat...

00:12:41.490 --> 00:12:43.080
Hammer!

00:12:49.010 --> 00:12:50.540
It flies?!

00:13:00.800 --> 00:13:02.380
Don't fly! Don't dodge!

00:13:02.380 --> 00:13:04.070
Let me hit you!

00:13:04.070 --> 00:13:07.720
I don't think it wants you to hit it...

00:13:07.970 --> 00:13:08.680
Yosuke!

00:13:15.490 --> 00:13:17.750
It's dangerous here! We're leaving!

00:13:19.260 --> 00:13:21.430
But... But...

00:13:21.430 --> 00:13:25.630
If they have to worry about us while 
they fight, it'll put them in danger!

00:13:26.100 --> 00:13:28.730
And even if we save Kumashiro-san,

00:13:28.730 --> 00:13:31.370
there'll be no point to it
if you've gotten hurt, right?

00:13:31.370 --> 00:13:32.790
Y-Yeah.

00:13:33.180 --> 00:13:34.400
Good girl.

00:13:34.400 --> 00:13:35.000
Let's go.

00:13:38.960 --> 00:13:40.540
That was close.

00:13:40.850 --> 00:13:43.800
Is Inaba-san okay?

00:13:43.800 --> 00:13:45.370
Torai-san's with her.

00:13:45.370 --> 00:13:46.510
Trust him to handle it!

00:13:46.770 --> 00:13:49.560
Sensei! Sensei, can't you fly?

00:13:50.970 --> 00:13:54.690
It's possible. It was a trump 
card I didn't want to use, but...

00:13:54.690 --> 00:13:56.190
I don't have a choice!

00:13:56.190 --> 00:13:58.370
That's what Sensei says!

00:13:58.370 --> 00:14:00.130
If you can do it, then do it!

00:14:00.130 --> 00:14:01.810
If we're dead, then it's too late!

00:14:03.710 --> 00:14:04.880
Got it!

00:14:05.410 --> 00:14:08.110
Cat Doping, fire!

00:14:22.450 --> 00:14:24.190
Throw me over there!

00:14:25.100 --> 00:14:26.550
Okay!

00:14:36.700 --> 00:14:38.870
A special boosting item for adults,

00:14:38.870 --> 00:14:41.480
sure to give you a hangover the next day!

00:14:41.480 --> 00:14:44.360
Cosmos Matanbi-Z!

00:14:44.730 --> 00:14:46.630
What's a hangover?

00:14:47.500 --> 00:14:49.450
Oh, that opens.

00:14:49.450 --> 00:14:53.790
Tomorrow you'll regret your thirst for power!

00:14:54.270 --> 00:14:55.970
You don't pop the lid first, huh?

00:15:19.690 --> 00:15:21.050
It changed form!

00:15:21.280 --> 00:15:23.650
It had a trick like that up its sleeve?

00:15:29.490 --> 00:15:31.780
I grew wings! My arm grew back!

00:15:32.120 --> 00:15:34.600
Wow, you can do it after all!

00:15:35.550 --> 00:15:37.020
"Tomorrow's gonna suck,"

00:15:37.020 --> 00:15:39.230
Sensei says.

00:15:40.000 --> 00:15:40.750
Why's that?

00:15:41.390 --> 00:15:44.770
Well, it doesn't matter. I'm feeling excited.

00:15:45.120 --> 00:15:46.320
So here I go!

00:15:48.250 --> 00:15:49.590
Cat Claws!

00:15:49.590 --> 00:15:52.300
Giga Cat Blade!

00:15:53.610 --> 00:15:54.470
Did I get it?

00:16:00.460 --> 00:16:01.190
It wasn't enough!

00:16:05.920 --> 00:16:07.100
Don't block it head on, deflect it!

00:16:07.100 --> 00:16:08.230
Shield!

00:16:14.490 --> 00:16:15.310
Yes!

00:16:15.310 --> 00:16:16.700
We did it!

00:16:20.230 --> 00:16:21.510
Wow...

00:16:24.060 --> 00:16:25.250
Here I go!

00:16:26.690 --> 00:16:28.130
You're mincemeat!

00:16:28.810 --> 00:16:31.560
Sensei wouldn't say that!

00:16:32.190 --> 00:16:34.520
Let's get a little further away.
 Can you walk?

00:16:35.130 --> 00:16:36.850
U-Um...

00:16:38.930 --> 00:16:39.910
I...

00:16:40.470 --> 00:16:41.390
No.

00:16:44.660 --> 00:16:49.560
I... I want to be strong!

00:16:50.750 --> 00:16:51.860
I'm sorry!

00:16:52.140 --> 00:16:53.570
I'm going back!

00:16:56.880 --> 00:16:59.660
Okay, I'll go back with you.

00:17:00.880 --> 00:17:01.700
Let's go.

00:17:02.070 --> 00:17:03.580
You can become strong.

00:17:04.820 --> 00:17:05.460
I will!

00:17:06.080 --> 00:17:07.510
But what will we do when you get back there?

00:17:07.510 --> 00:17:10.270
Keep calling out to Haru-chan 
until she hears me.

00:17:10.270 --> 00:17:12.610
Sheesh! That's like something
 out of a manga.

00:17:12.610 --> 00:17:16.260
But you're into manga like
 that too, right, Torai-san?

00:17:30.730 --> 00:17:31.730
Be careful.

00:17:32.320 --> 00:17:33.440
I'm sorry.

00:17:36.360 --> 00:17:39.280
Haru-chan, can you hear me?

00:17:39.690 --> 00:17:41.290
Stop it!

00:17:41.290 --> 00:17:42.880
Don't fight!

00:17:46.080 --> 00:17:48.400
I guess that won't work
 like it would a manga.

00:17:48.400 --> 00:17:51.810
I thought it might work 
if a psychic tried it...

00:17:52.220 --> 00:17:53.170
Haru-chan!

00:17:54.420 --> 00:17:55.800
She hears you.

00:18:00.970 --> 00:18:04.700
Use your psychic powers to 
share what's in your heart.

00:18:04.700 --> 00:18:07.240
That's the path that leads
 to the evolution of love.

00:18:07.240 --> 00:18:08.560
Now, give me your hand.

00:18:08.980 --> 00:18:10.010
Who are you?

00:18:12.910 --> 00:18:14.860
Please, save her!

00:18:20.160 --> 00:18:22.240
Soya-kun! Sensei!

00:18:22.240 --> 00:18:22.870
Come here!

00:18:25.840 --> 00:18:27.080
She's the key!

00:18:27.770 --> 00:18:28.580
Huh?

00:18:34.640 --> 00:18:37.470
Get her and me close to it.

00:18:37.470 --> 00:18:38.690
We'll persuade it.

00:18:38.690 --> 00:18:40.010
Persuade it?

00:18:40.010 --> 00:18:41.480
It's a dragon!

00:18:41.480 --> 00:18:42.530
That's impossible, idiot!

00:18:42.530 --> 00:18:43.600
Who are you calling an idiot?!

00:18:43.940 --> 00:18:46.080
And that's Haru-chan!

00:18:46.080 --> 00:18:47.230
It's not a dragon!

00:18:49.500 --> 00:18:51.690
Take me to her, please!

00:18:55.840 --> 00:18:56.850
Soya-kun!

00:19:00.560 --> 00:19:01.990
Fine.

00:19:01.990 --> 00:19:02.910
Here.

00:19:04.510 --> 00:19:06.980
When we get close, you can throw us!

00:19:08.240 --> 00:19:09.160
Seriously?

00:19:10.130 --> 00:19:11.380
Leave it to me!

00:19:11.380 --> 00:19:13.790
D-Don't die, okay?

00:19:20.930 --> 00:19:21.550
What?

00:19:21.960 --> 00:19:24.040
I'm throwing you! Don't blame
 whatever's next on me!

00:19:24.040 --> 00:19:25.230
Okay!

00:19:25.230 --> 00:19:26.350
Please!

00:19:34.210 --> 00:19:35.110
Haru-kun!

00:19:41.110 --> 00:19:43.130
Mi...u...chan...

00:19:44.740 --> 00:19:47.290
Haru-kun!

00:19:57.480 --> 00:19:58.680
Don't give in!

00:19:58.680 --> 00:20:01.360
Don't give in to your anger!

00:20:03.340 --> 00:20:04.640
Miu-chan?

00:20:05.290 --> 00:20:06.510
Haru-chan...

00:20:07.510 --> 00:20:10.780
I've always been big

00:20:11.330 --> 00:20:13.280
and stronger than the boys...

00:20:14.160 --> 00:20:15.730
Everybody was scared of me!

00:20:16.590 --> 00:20:21.240
Do you even want to be around me?

00:20:24.550 --> 00:20:26.330
Of course I'm not scared of you!

00:20:26.680 --> 00:20:29.070
You're so cute!

00:20:30.380 --> 00:20:32.010
Thank you...

00:20:33.340 --> 00:20:35.750
Miu-chan, you're so strong.

00:20:49.760 --> 00:20:51.140
That's right.

00:20:51.660 --> 00:20:53.450
This is how it should go.

00:20:59.430 --> 00:21:00.900
Are you really okay?

00:21:01.250 --> 00:21:03.270
I want to carry her.

00:21:03.270 --> 00:21:06.030
And I'm pretty strong, too!

00:21:07.530 --> 00:21:09.100
Nebula Soldier...

00:21:09.100 --> 00:21:10.120
Sorry for the trouble.

00:21:11.110 --> 00:21:12.840
No need to thank us.

00:21:12.840 --> 00:21:14.330
We got what we wanted.

00:21:15.290 --> 00:21:16.540
That's Kumashiro-san's...

00:21:16.540 --> 00:21:17.980
When did that happen?

00:21:17.980 --> 00:21:19.220
It's okay.

00:21:19.220 --> 00:21:21.590
I'll talk to Haru-chan later.

00:21:22.470 --> 00:21:25.340
We probably won't fight anymore.

00:21:25.340 --> 00:21:26.600
But...

00:21:26.600 --> 00:21:28.530
It's okay, Yosuke.

00:21:30.330 --> 00:21:33.590
Now, I want to ask you something.

00:21:38.960 --> 00:21:41.950
<i>The morning after the explosion,</i>

00:21:41.950 --> 00:21:44.100
<i>we have a better view of the damage.</i>

00:21:44.400 --> 00:21:51.120
<b>Live Footage: Explosion Update...</b>

00:21:44.440 --> 00:21:48.970
<i>thankfully, after the large mysterious 
object appeared in the mountains,</i>

00:21:48.970 --> 00:21:51.120
<i>the surrounding locals evacuated.</i>

00:21:55.130 --> 00:21:57.790
My head hurts. I feel sick...

00:21:59.260 --> 00:22:01.830
"This is the side effect of Cat Doping."

00:22:01.830 --> 00:22:03.840
"We call it a hangover."

00:22:03.840 --> 00:22:05.760
That's what Sensei says.

00:22:06.450 --> 00:22:07.760
Want some water?

00:22:07.760 --> 00:22:10.490
It was Sensei who powered up.

00:22:10.490 --> 00:22:12.220
Why is this happening to me?

00:22:12.410 --> 00:22:15.180
Both of you were fighting, remember?

00:22:15.580 --> 00:22:17.120
I have to go to school.

00:22:17.120 --> 00:22:20.280
I told Nozo-san I'd see her tomorrow.

00:22:20.280 --> 00:22:21.400
"Nozo-san"?

00:22:28.210 --> 00:22:29.660
How is Nezuya looking?

00:22:29.850 --> 00:22:30.980
Fine.

00:22:30.980 --> 00:22:32.820
He's just asleep.

00:22:32.820 --> 00:22:35.830
By the way, I heard that 
Kumashiro-kun went out of control.

00:22:36.030 --> 00:22:39.600
We resolved it by joining forces 
with the Nebula Soldiers.

00:22:39.600 --> 00:22:41.380
More importantly,
there's something I want to ask you.

00:22:42.190 --> 00:22:45.680
What is your real goal, Director?

00:22:46.460 --> 00:22:48.050
True peace.

00:22:48.300 --> 00:22:50.320
Peace? Brought about how?

00:22:50.320 --> 00:22:52.550
After eliminating the invaders,

00:22:52.550 --> 00:22:54.340
creating a uniform ideal of justice,

00:22:54.340 --> 00:22:56.050
a uniform set of values,

00:22:56.050 --> 00:22:59.110
and a uniform set of ethics and morals.

00:22:59.110 --> 00:22:59.730
All of that—

00:23:00.540 --> 00:23:04.070
—will be brought about by psychic violence?

00:23:04.420 --> 00:23:05.530
Correct.

00:23:05.530 --> 00:23:07.320
You're talking about world conquest.

00:23:07.640 --> 00:23:08.740
Correct.

00:23:13.540 --> 00:23:15.020
Are you a child?

00:23:15.890 --> 00:23:17.420
You can have this back.

00:23:17.420 --> 00:23:19.370
It's too much for me.

00:23:19.830 --> 00:23:21.530
I'm out.

00:23:21.530 --> 00:23:22.080
Benika!

00:23:23.130 --> 00:23:25.300
I don't want to be swallowed up by my power.

00:23:33.860 --> 00:23:35.190
Benika!

00:23:37.020 --> 00:23:40.020
<b><i>To Be Continued</i></b>

00:23:40.020 --> 00:23:45.150
<b><i>Next Time
Paladin Break 1</i></b>

00:23:42.040 --> 00:23:44.530
"Paladin Break 1."
